WEBVTT

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.030
On iPhone, open Encounters
and choose Flagged.

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:05.280
A flagged encounter shows a safety alert

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:07.670
with the moments Sentinel
marked for review.

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:10.870
The encounter is preserved,
with no action required.

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:14.390
Sentinel does not contact clients
or anyone outside your practice.
